From: Naveen S <quic_naves@quicinc.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Sep 2024 11:19:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] sigma_dut: Restructuring to extend multi link support

Currently only two links are being supported via sigma
and two variables are being used for each link for every feature
which limits in reusing the varibles at certain times and limits
to extend the multi link support if needed.

Providing support by adding a new structure "mld_ap" which
will hold all the link specific variables which eases the code
accessibililty and reusability.

Signed-off-by: Dhanavandhana Kannan <quic_dhanavan@quicinc.com>
Signed-off-by: Naveen S <quic_naves@quicinc.com>
